      <description align="left" color="orange" colored="true" height="104" resized="true" width="388" x="283" y="146">For each point, calculate LOF's by varying K from lower MinPts to upper MinPts. Then take max LOF as outlier score&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Suppose that records with outlier score &amp;gt; 2 are considered strong outliers&lt;br&gt;</description>
